   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Lin has 13 mystery novels. Each month, she gets 2 more. <strong>Select three</strong> expressions that represent the total number of mystery novels Lin has after 3 months.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"13 + 2 + 2+ 2\">13 + 2 + 2+ 2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"13 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2\">13 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"13 \\cdot 8\">13 \\cdot 8</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"13 + 6\">13 + 6</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"19\">19</span></li>\n</ol>",
